<title>MALTA: Malta detains two Cypriot-registered trawlers.</title>
<headline>Malta detains two Cypriot-registered trawlers.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Captains of two Cypriot- registered trawlers were charged in a Maltese court on Wednesday for allegedly fishing in the Maltese fishing zone, officials said.</p>
<p>The government's Information Department said the trawler Neapolis, captained by a Greek national, and the Alexander K, with an Egyptian skipper, were found fishing just over 19 miles southeast of Malta.</p>
<p>They were escorted by a patrol boat to Malta's Grand Harbour late on Tuesday.</p>
